        },
        {
          "name": "Net Factory Id",
          "type": "UE::Net::FNetObjectFactoryId"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "FNetRefHandle",
      "docs": "Start replicating a SubObject and return a valid NetRefHandle if successful.\n@param OwnerHandle The owner of the subobject\n@param Instance The instance that needs to be replicated\n@param InsertRelativeToSubObjectHandle When valid the new subobject will be inserted in the subobject replication list next to the specified handle and the wanted insertion order.\n@param InsertionOrder When none will always add the new subobject at the end of the list.\n@return The NetRefHandle of the subobject if successful."
    },
